messages "roxanne**To: averySubj: HI LOVE!!!Date: Jul 22I'm horrible, Iam a wretc.I'm a horrible friend and a terrible slacker and I'm not going to lie to you...Bu I honestly have meant to write you for the longest time...and then I got into that rut of \"I haven't written her in so long...it's almost embarrassing.\"  Man, Dix, I'm sorry.If it makes it any better I think about you a lot and wonder how you're doing.  You're such a sweetheart, and no matter how much I try...oh hell...no more whining.  I don't know how often you're on here, but they purged the mail and all the addresses that I neglected to write down were erased, so I don't have your most recent address that you left here for me, but I do have the old one...There's just no excuse for me, right?  *HUG*  AH well...tell you what...I just went on vacation and wen't totally camera happy...so give me your address and I'll send you recent pictures of me on the beach *woo hoo* and me and my honey.  (Yep, still the same guy I took to your wedding...go figure :) )OPEFULLY I'll hear from you soon...Take care and give James a big hi and a hug from me.Love you, Christa**roxanne**To: averySubj: I wish I could talk to you!!!Date: Aug 30I wish I wasn't such a schmuck to lose your address, but I have to tell you....I'M ENGAGED!!!!!  *cheer*  *blush*  *scream*  *jump*  (pandemonium.[D.[D.[D.[D.[D.[D.[D.[D.[D.[C.[C.[C.[C.[C.[C.[C.[C.[C) :)I wish I could talk to you, or get in touch with you some way besides on here.  We've set a date for August 30, next year.  Keep it in mind ;)I hope I hear from you soon...I miss sharing fun, exciting news with you.  :)Oh, and yeah, it's Rob ;)I love you, Christa**"
